  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add Win32-inspired, themeable horizontal and vertical scrollbar behavior to standalone controls and multiline editors. Use arrow buttons, track paging, thumb dragging, wheel/cross-axis keys, auto-repeat, and standard context menus through one semantic route. Add opt-in no-wrap editor horizontal scrolling, two-axis corner composition, bounded Unicode-aware extent discovery, and anchored WidgetPopupMenu.OpenAt. Preserve AssemblyVersion 1.0.0.0, Icod.DCurses 2.5.2, and the .NET 8/9/10 targets.",
